[9059]="7005984E\n1\tDefeat invading snow-beasts at Gabilazan (total: 6)\030Fend off the vicious cold at Gabilazan (total: 4)\tYour mission is to repel the meddlesome stone-giant troubling the dwarves at Gabilazan.\n2\tYour mission is to repel the meddlesome stone-giant troubling the dwarves at Gabilazan.\t\n3\tSecure the gate at Gabilazan\tYour mission is to repel the meddlesome stone-giant troubling the dwarves at Gabilazan.\n",
