[9063]="70059564\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at Trader's Wharf to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tGet into position to defend Trader's Wharf!\tYou should get into position to defend Trader's Wharf. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tDefeat the attackers\030Defend Trader's Wharf!\tYou should defend Trader's Wharf from the attackers. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
