[9065]="70062D4A\n1\tSpeak with the mission giver\tSpeak with the mission giver when you are ready to continue your investigation of the Greyflood.\n2\tReturn to Hithriel and tell him of your findings\tHaving discovered a possible source of the disturbance of the Greyflood, you need to return to the mission giver to let him know what you have found.\n",
